# This file collects the Intel® Processor Trace full trace mode tests on
# Intel® Architecture-based platforms.
# @hw_dep: cpuid_check 7 0 0 0 b 25 @ CPU doesn't support Intel PT CPUID.(EAX=07H,ECX=0H):EBX[bit 25]
# @other_dep:
# @other_warn:

# Full trace of the calling task with user space excluded, check the packets
# the decoder is expected to find
bat_ipt 3 1

# Same check with kernel space excluded
bat_ipt 3 2

# Repeat the check on every CPU, without any privilege level filter
bat_ipt 5 0

# Same per CPU check with user space excluded
bat_ipt 5 1

# Same per CPU check with kernel space excluded
bat_ipt 5 2

# Doing the full trace check with non root user
nonroot_test 1
